exists su name video cuts audio filename ob text "/workplace/artifacts/say/love-teaching.wav" be default ya
exists su name video cuts prefix ob text "love-teaching" be default ya

su name love teaching full be refinery def

su name manuscript ob text "Write a spoken teaching manuscript that teaches people how to love God. Focus on concrete actions humans can take to love God (prayer, obedience, gratitude, trust). Do not focus on God loving people. Target about 90 words, plain language, no lists, no markdown." for name mind to name text manuscript out be write do

su name telling from ve name manuscript ob name manuscript out to filename "/workplace/artifacts/say/love-teaching.wav" be piper say do

su name hear from ve name telling from filename "/workplace/artifacts/say/love-teaching.wav" become wo srt to filename "/workplace/artifacts/footnote/love-teaching.srt" be hear do

su name cut platform from filename "/workplace/artifacts/footnote/love-teaching.srt" during num 6 to name itinerary teaching cuts be cut do

su name draw platform from name itinerary teaching cuts ob text "Create one cinematic illustration per cut. Keep continuity across cuts, no text in image, and make each image directly depict the cut content." fromstate wo text become wo photograph as text "love-teaching" be draw do

su name concatenate platform from name itinerary teaching cuts fromstate wo itinerary become wo video to filename "/workplace/artifacts/video/love-teaching.mp4" be concatenate do

su name report ob text "Generated /workplace/artifacts/video/love-teaching.mp4" be write do
prah

from name love teaching full be refinery do
ob text "ls -lh /workplace/artifacts/video/love-teaching.mp4" to name text video preview be command do
ob name video preview be write do
